    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8259" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεμ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>windy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σκῦρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					553
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				96
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρωτήριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.967b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτος ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					360b5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύματα ἀ.</span>”
				<i>bringing wind,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					932b29
