			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σημεῖον ἀ.</span> a sign <i>of
				wind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>vain, idle,</i> Hsch.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραπαταλίας.</span>
			</div>
